    "sections": {
        "description": "CV Resume Portfolio is a clean and modern free theme designed for building a personal online presence with a structured layout for showcasing skills, work experience, education, achievements, and projects through CV, resume, biodata, and portfolio templates. It is suitable for job seekers and personal mentor profiles who want to present their qualifications in a clear, organized, and minimalist grid-based format. Designers can use the theme to display creative work in a simple and accessible portfolio layout, while developers benefit from its lightweight and responsive design that ensures consistent performance across devices. Freelancers can present services, past projects, and client work in dedicated sections, and consultants may use it to outline expertise and professional background effectively. Creative professionals and interior designers can build a personal portfolio that highlights their work visually without unnecessary complexity. The theme includes sections such as About Me, Education, Experience, Skills, Portfolio, and Contact Information, along with customization options for colors, typography, and content. It supports responsive design, an SEO-friendly structure, and compatibility with useful tools like the Contact Form 7 plugin for managing communication and inquiries efficiently."
    },
